  "description": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B (revision 2fc06364) chat generation in-process on ONNX Runtime GenAI 0.17.1: the pinned chat template rendered in C# for text and tool-calling conversations (system, user, assistant and tool messages, tool definitions and calls, thinking switch; images rejected), a parser for the template's tool-call format (whole or streamed), prompt ids from the owned tokenizer (Starlings.Tokenizers profile qwen35-bpe-chat: no Microsoft.ML.Tokenizers, no GenAI tokenizer), and Starling's decode loop (greedy or seeded sampling, stop tokens and strings, streaming, cancellation between steps, usage). Ships the asset lock, not the weights. Profiles qwen3.5-0.8b/ortgenai-fp32x (CPU; CUDA with TF32 off) and ortgenai-fp16x (CUDA), Linux x64, experimental. The application adds Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntimeGenAI or Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntimeGenAI.Cuda. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
